---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="About Us">
  <h1 style="color: #2c3e50;">About ScholarRepo</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #555; line-height: 1.8;">
    ScholarRepo is a real-time academic document repository index. We aim to provide fast, lightweight, and efficient access to journal metadata, abstracts, and DOIs from various global publishers.
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #555; line-height: 1.8;">
    Our system utilizes the OpenAlex and Crossref APIs to aggregate data dynamically, ensuring researchers have access to the most up-to-date bibliographic information without heavy server footprints.
  </p>
</MainLayout>